istorical propaganda is contextualized, no taste traits.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p417047274","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p420515372"],"reference":"ol:OL33393100W","checked_at":"2026-11-02T21:30:06.460Z","supplemental":null,"existingAlternativeReview":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-013.json","sources":["https://uitgeverijprometheus.nl/boeken/mijn-strijd-gebonden/","https://www.bibliotheek.nl/catalogus/titel.417047274.html/mijn-strijd/","https://id.rijksmuseum.nl/300287283","https://www.ifz-muenchen.de/heftarchiv/1992_2.pdf","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL33393100W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p417047274","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p420515372"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"99801c6b042811c386b73065660a86526a9fe405ea2064d642e0cd5d8840b39f","cover_id":13126197,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and source-edition binding; no barcode assertion."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://uitgeverijprometheus.nl/boeken/mijn-strijd-gebonden/","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T21:30:06.46+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-018","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987317001},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987217003},"seq":4,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":987117001,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact2018Prometheus annotated Dutch MeinKampf, translatorMarioMolegraaf/editorWillemMelching are separate from primary authorHitler. Reuse currentWork793, not a second Work for Dutch annotations. Correct invalid original1922 to first volumeJuly1925 per InstitutfürZeitgeschichtescholarly publication; secondvolumeDecember1926 not collapsed into fake1924. Historical propaganda is contextualized, no taste tra