 op verschillende manieren naar betekenis. Narziss richt zich op het denken en het beschouwende kloosterleven. Goldmund voelt zich aangetrokken tot ervaringen buiten die besloten omgeving en tot het kunstenaarschap. Hun uiteenlopende levenswegen maken zichtbaar wat ieder waardeert en wat daarbij buiten bereik blijft. Hermann Hesse onderzoekt via hun verhouding de spanning tussen orde en verlangen, geestelijke toewijding en het leven dat zich door ontmoetingen en waarnemingen laat vormen.","work_id":987117002,"evidence":[{"note":"DutchNarziss&Goldmund is the same1930German novel as currentWork4838, confirmed by exactISBN9789041330215 and authority. Alternate sourceparentOL873015W does not justify anotherWork. RetaincurrentWorkOL873100W, primaryHermannHesse, all existing EN edition and user links. Title & versus en is a source-punctuation variant.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p148265561","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p168330156"],"reference":"ol:OL873015W","checked_at":"2026-11-02T21:30:06.460Z","supplemental":{"review":"ExactDutchISBN9789041330215 and cover Narziss &Goldmund; KB spells same title with en. PrimarysourceOL76437A and KBauthority share Q25973/VIAF41841418/ISNI0000000121296240. OriginalNarzissundGoldmund1930; sourceparentOL873015W resolves to existingWork4838OL873100W per separate reviewed identity. No Work or author merge.","formatSource":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p168330156"},"existingAlternativeReview":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-amendment-001.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL873100W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p148265561","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p168330156","https://www.dhm.de/lemo/biografie/hermann-hesse"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"daacc38f9b08d382f2f11f58a2bceb553a692701d2501de1298d9bccb2cd0eda","cover_id":6870449,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actua